{"availability":"available","full":"latextemplates/ieee-enhanced","name":"ieee-enhanced","description":"Quick start for modern LaTeXing for an IEEE conference","category":"Other","language":"TeX","stars":119,"forks":38,"created":"2018-01-28T20:30:45Z","updated":"2026-10-18T10:55:11Z","license":"0BSD","branch":"main","homepage":"https://latextemplates.github.io/ieee-enhanced/","topics":["ieeetran","latex","latex-template"],"demo":"https://latextemplates.github.io/ieee-enhanced/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:29:01.521Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:29:01.521Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:29:01.521Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:08.134Z","stars":119,"forks":38},{"at":"2026-10-12T06:26:56.406Z","stars":119,"forks":38},{"at":"2026-10-18T11:29:01.521Z","stars":119,"forks":38}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Quick start for modern LaTeXing for an IEEE conference, based on the Manuscript Template for Conference Proceedings.","Please be aware that this template is optimized for overleaf, which is based on TeXLive 2025. In case you are running a later TeXLive version (or use MiKTeX), please regenerate the template with the help of the [latex template generator].","The official template is distributed via CTAN as the IEEEtran package, which is actively maintained. However, de-facto configurations (hyperref) and modern features of latex (microtype) are not configured. This template does it."],"features":["Provides a skeletal paper.tex file","Shows how IEEE copyright notice can be added.","(Optional) Typesetting of listings using advanced highlighting powered by the [minted] package.","Generated PDF allows for copy and paste of text without getting words with ligatures such as \"workflow\" destroyed.","Ligatures are removed if they are typeset at the wrong place."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/latextemplates/ieee-enhanced/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"804e8748651161ecbce63da94ef7d